		"description": "{Protected from Creature Attacks}\nEnemy creatures cannot deliberately target this unit with ordinary melee or ranged attacks while this protection remains active. This does not prevent spells or collateral damage."
	},
	"CASUALTY_DAMAGE_PERCENTAGE": {
		"description": "{Casualty-Scaled Damage}\nOrdinary melee attacks and retaliations against the primary victim gain damage from the applicable native-count casualty deficit. Wounds alone do not count."
	},
