		"description": "{Physical Defense}\nThis unit gains ${val} Creature Defense against physical attacks. This bonus does not reduce magical damage."
	},
	"NATIVE_RESISTANCE_REFLECTION": {
		"description": "{Native Resistance Reflection}\nOn the ordinary resistance roll, this unit's native ${val}% Magic Resistance outcome is replaced by hostile-spell reflection, subject to normal eligibility and caps. This adds no Magic Resistance or independent chance. Illegal reflection is resisted; reflected spells cannot reflect again."
	}
